    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Fuller Heights’ history is closely tied to phosphate mining, which shaped much of the county’s economy and landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.floridasmart.com/city-guide/fuller-heights",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community grew as families moved in during the rapid expansion of the phosphate mining industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/fuller_heights_florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Historical phosphate mining in the Bone Valley region disturbed 3,000 to 6,000 acres annually, with 25‑30% being wetlands or surface waters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/fuller_heights_florida",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Agriculture and mining remain part of Fuller Heights’ local identity, while new residents and developments create a diverse, growing community.",
